      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>transformer</code> - the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.instrument/java/lang/instrument/ClassFileTransformer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.instrument\"><code>ClassFileTransformer</code></a> to register",
      "translation": "<code>transformer</code> - 要注册的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.instrument/java/lang/instrument/ClassFileTransformer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.instrument\"><code>ClassFileTransformer</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
